<title>UK: Banco BMG sets $100 mln 8-year bond.</title>
<headline>Banco BMG sets $100 mln 8-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager BankBoston.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO BMG</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    *  JUL.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    =</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+365</p>
<p> NOTES   *  CALL AND PUT AT PAR IN JULY 2000 AND JULY 2002</p>
<p>	   ** TO BE PRICED OVER THE 3-YEAR WHEN-ISSUED US TREASURY</p>
<p>NOTE</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
